      "is_current": true,
      "date_precision": "month",
      "description": "Building AI systems, products and high-performance teams. With my head in the clouds and my feet on the ground, I'm a product builder driven by creativity, data and purpose. I use my experience in technology, systems architecture and automation to turn ideas into real solutions that create value quickly. When an idea does not hold up, I would rather find out early and stop without wasting time, energy or investment. Today, one of the hardest problems I work on is how to scale engineering teams with AI without lowering the quality bar. I build harnesses, ways of working and closed validation…"
