      "date_precision": "month",
      "description": "I worked for a few months in Justto's controllership during the final stages of the deal and the transition after it. It was a temporary role focused on keeping the company organized while the transaction was being completed. I already knew the product, the team and the company deeply, so I could connect the financial and operational work with what was really happening in the business."
    },
    {
      "title": "Co-Founder & CTO",
      "company": "Justto",
      "start": "2021-10",
      "end": "2023-01",
      "is_current": false,
      "date_precision": "month",
      "description": "I was co-founder and CTO of Justto. We built the product, the team and the operation from the beginning. My work was not only technology. I was involved in product, architecture, people, delivery, production and the decisions needed to make the company grow with scale. The platform transacted more than BRL 1 billion in legal agreements. We built a strong team, received important awards and the company was acquired by Starian. Before ChatGPT, we were already testing OpenAI models and using them directly in parts of the product."
    },
    {
      "title": "Senior Systems Architect",
