      "date_precision": "month",
      "description": "I joined Justto as a co-founder while the company and the product were still in the early stage. My role was very hands-on: I helped turn the business idea into a product that could operate in the real world. I worked on architecture, backend, frontend, integrations, databases and production. At the same time, I helped shape technical decisions, the first team and the operation that later needed to scale."
